<title>POLAND: Echo 96 group net rises to PLN 2.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Echo 96 group net rises to PLN 2.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Echo Investment group results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		     5.96   vs    0.72</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			 5.36   vs    0.70</p>
<p>    Group net profit			     2.84   vs    0.41</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Echo Investment SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			     19.43   vs    7.31</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales			14.23   vs    6.38</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    Group income tax			     2.51   vs    0.29</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		   2.93   vs    0.14</p>
<p>    Group financial costs			3.43   vs    0.16</p>
<p>    Group investment			    17.93   vs    2.83</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
